 "remarks": "WALKING DISTANCE TO EVERYTHING DARIEN HAS TO OFFER! Conveniently located to downtown, newly constructed Corbin District, train station, restaurants, shops and I95. Recently updated kitchen, freshly painted, new energy efficient windows and new hardwood floors throughout, this charming 2 bedroom/1 full bath half duplex offers tons of natural light and ample off street parking. Private patio with backyard space, washer/dryer on main floor. Storage in basement. Tenant responsible for credit check, 2 months security deposit (1 month is 62 or older) and 1st months rent due at signing of lease, all utilities including electric, heat (oil), hot water, internet/cable, trash collection and personal property and liability insurance. No smoking, cats ok but no dogs. Incredible value in a must see location!",
